 Computational power amplification confirmed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_28","text":"Initiating Ark creation sequence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_29","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_29","text":"*Woooooooooooong*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_30","text":"The white pillar begins to vibrate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_31","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_31","text":"It feels like the ground itself is rippling.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_32","text":"Everyone, brace yourselves!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_33","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_33","text":"The ground begins to undulate wildly,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_34","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_34","text":"and white blocks begin to shoot up like seedlings sprouting out of the ground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_35","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_35","text":"At the same time, the crystals in the area shatter to pieces.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_36","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_36","text":"Some blocks rise for a moment and stop, while others continue to surge up into the air seemingly without end. They assume a panoply of different shapes: triangles, ovals, diamonds, and more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_37","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_37","text":"After a few moments, the blocks cease their movement.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_38","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_38","text":"In what was once a foreign land, there is now a familiar landscape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"APillar","bgArt":"apillar","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_39","text":"It's... become a Lost Sector.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_40","text":"Construction complete. A Pillar status all normal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["eunhwa","mana_op","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_41","text":"Linking with Harmony Cube and expanding the area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_42","text":"Holy crap! This place is unrecognizable now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_43","text":"Think of this pillar as a pseudo-Harmony Cube, one which was created by the Harmony Cube itself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_44","text":"We can expand the structures around the area where the A Pillar is embedded.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_45","text":"Being made of glass, all of this material is immune to the E2 Crystals, so it can push them out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_46","text":"Additionally, the A Pillar is tied to the Harmony Cube's computational power, so the more you install, the better the Harmony Cube's computation ability.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_47","text":"Er...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_48","text":"I didn't quite catch all of that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_49","text":"None of this makes any sense to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_50","text":"How can these structures just appear out of thin air?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_51","text":"You're right, it doesn't make any logical sense. But you just saw it with your own eyes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_52","text":"How does the science behind all of this work? Although to be honest, I don't think I'd understand even if you did explain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_53","text":"That's classified information.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_54","text":"How come?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_55","text":"Do you really think this process follows the laws of physics or basic energy principles?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_56","text":"I don't think so... I guess? I don't know, none of this makes any sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_57","text":"That's precisely why it's confidential. Does that answer your question?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_58","text":"Not at all!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_59","text":"Be quiet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_60","text":"Aren't any of you curious about this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_61","text":"You just said yourself that you wouldn't understand even if you were given an explanation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_62","text":"It's like watching a documentary on quantum physics. Even if you don't understand every bit, it's still nice to know...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_63","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_64","text":"Try and use that peabrain of yours for one second.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_65","text":"If the reason why this stuff works the way it does wasn't classified, and if it was something that everyone could understand,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_66","text":"it could end up being used for terrorism.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_67","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_68","text":"Like you said, it defies all common sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_69","text":"Do you really think something like that will be easy to understand?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_70","text":"... Probably not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_71","text":"Exactly. Hence why it's classified.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_72","text":"For someone who says they don't care, you've got an awful lot to say about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_73","text":"I don't know. I don't need to know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_74","text":"So our objective is to plant these pillars here and there?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_75","text":"Then these structures that manifest as a result will wipe out all the crystals?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_76","text":"Correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_77","text":"Sounds kinda fun, like a game!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_31_03_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_31_03_78","text":"... We're moving out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}